# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
build/

# Editor
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/._*

# Environment (keep .env.example)
# 反选不带通配符：带通配符的反选会关掉 BuildKit fsutil 的目录剪枝，逼构建端递归遍历
# 每一个被排除目录。门禁见 tests/unit/core/test_dockerignore_context_pruning.py。
# 反选还必须排在排除之后：dockerignore 由最后一条命中的规则定胜负。
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!.env.example

# Credentials and private key material
# 每条都带 `**/` 前缀：dockerignore 锚定 context 根、`*` 不跨越 `/`，裸 `*.key` 只管
# 根目录那一层，src/ 下的凭据照进 context。本 context 的 Dockerfile 用 `COPY . .`。
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pkcs12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.der
**/*.ovpn
**/id_rsa
**/id_dsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.pub
**/.ssh/
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/.npmrc
**/.authinfo
**/.authinfo.gpg
**/.pgpass
**/.my.cnf
**/.git-credentials
**/.vault-token
**/pip.conf
**/pip.ini
**/credentials.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.json
**/secret*.json
**/auth.json
**/.docker/config.json
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/.aws/
**/.azure/
**/.config/gcloud/
**/.kube/config
**/*.kubeconfig

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Cache
.cache/
.temp/
coverage/

# Git
.git/

# Docker files (avoid recursion)
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml

# Local agent configuration（常含 API key / MCP 凭据，且基本都不被 git 跟踪）
**/.agents/
**/.claude/
**/.codex/
**/.kiro/
**/.serena/
**/.cursor/
**/.continue/
**/.windsurf/
